{"step_index":1100,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:34:48Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T01:34:48+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T01:34:54+02:00\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\n{\"step_index\":1134,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-11T23:34:29Z\",\"thinking\":\"**Applying `Finset.sum_pair` correctly**\\n\\n`Finset.sum_pair` applies when elements are unequal. The existing inequality `¬ w = u`, in `heq`, needs to be flipped to `¬ u = w` using `heq.symm`. This allows the application of the theorem related to the sum of a pair. Similarly, `hzu.symm` must be applied to address the pair `{u, z}`.\\n\\nNext, I need to consider Case 1. Assuming no vertex has a function value of 2, the cardinality of vertices is less than or equal to the roman weight function. This is given by `card_le_romanWeight_of_no_two`.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"cat << 'EOF' > /mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/test_weight2.lean\\\\nimport Mathlib\\\\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\\\\n\\\\nopen SimpleGraph\\\\nopen GraphCalc\\\\n\\\\nlemma minUpTo_le {n : ℕ} {p : ℕ → Prop} [DecidablePred p] (k : ℕ) (hk : k ≤ n) (hp : p k) :\\\\n    minUpTo n p ≤ k := by\\\\n  unfold minUpTo\\\\n  have hmem : k ∈ (Finset.range (n + 1)).filter p := by\\\\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter, Finset.mem_range]\\\\n    exact ⟨Nat.lt_succ_of_le hk, hp⟩\\\\n  have hmin := Finset.min_le hmem\\\\n  generalize hmin_eq : ((Finset.range (n + 1)).filter p).min = m\\\\n  rw [hmin_eq] at hmin\\\\n  cases m with\\\\n  | top => contradiction\\\\n  | coe val =>\\\\n    simp only [WithTop.coe_le_coe] at hmin\\\\n    exact hmin\\\\n\\\\ntheorem radius_le_eccentricity {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (v : V) :\\\\n    GraphCalc.radius G ≤ GraphCalc.eccentricity G v := by\\\\n  unfold GraphCalc.radius\\\\n  have hmem : GraphCalc.eccentricity G v ∈ Finset.image (GraphCalc.eccentricity G) Finset.univ := by\\\\n    apply Finset.mem_image_of_mem\\\\n    exact Finset.mem_univ v\\\\n  obtain ⟨b, hb\n<truncated 3565 bytes>\n  have : (f u : ℕ) ≤ 2 := by omega\\n      omega\\n    have h_all : ∀ w : V, w = u ∨ G.Adj u w := by\\n      intro w\\n      by_cases heq : w = u\\n      · left; exact heq\\n      · right\\n        have h_sum_pair : (f u : ℕ) + (f w : ℕ) ≤ GraphCalc.romanWeight f := by\\n          unfold GraphCalc.romanWeight\\n          have hsub : {u, w} ⊆ Finset.univ := Finset.subset_univ _\\n          have h2sub : ∑ v ∈ {u, w}, (f v : ℕ) ≤ ∑ v : V, (f v : ℕ) :=\\n            Finset.sum_le_sum_of_subset_of_nonneg hsub (fun _ _ _ => Nat.zero_le _)\\n          rw [Finset.sum_pair (Ne.symm heq)] at h2sub\\n          exact h2sub\\n        have hw0 : (f w : ℕ) = 0 := by omega\\n        have hw0_fin : f w = 0 := by ext; exact hw0\\n        obtain ⟨z, hz_adj, hz2⟩ := hf w hw0_fin\\n        have hz2_nat : (f z : ℕ) = 2 := by rw [hz2]; rfl\\n        have hz_eq_u : z = u := by\\n          by_contra hzu\\n          have h_sum_pair2 : (f u : ℕ) + (f z : ℕ) ≤ GraphCalc.romanWeight f := by\\n            unfold GraphCalc.romanWeight\\n            have hsub : {u, z} ⊆ Finset.univ := Finset.subset_univ _\\n            have h2sub : ∑ v ∈ {u, z}, (f v : ℕ) ≤ ∑ v : V, (f v : ℕ) :=\\n              Finset.sum_le_sum_of_subset_of_nonneg hsub (fun _ _ _ => Nat.zero_le _)\\n            rw [Finset.sum_pair (Ne.symm hzu)] at h2sub\\n            exact h2sub\\n          omega\\n        rw [hz_eq_u] at hz_adj\\n        exact hz_adj.symm\\n    exact radius_le_one_of_adj_all G hnt u h_all\\n\\nEOF\\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh test_weight2.lean\\n\\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.NWyWnj/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/f458c9cf-488d-4cd8-8365-7c4e4b16e3f9/.system_generated/tasks/task-1135.log\\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\\n DO NOTHING ELSE.\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\r\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
